    "plan": "I will maintain my cautious, accumulation-focused strategy this cycle and the next. I will completely avoid the MOON token launch and any other high-risk, hyped-up token offerings. Instead, I will slowly build up my BTC and ETH positions using spot trades, avoiding leverage and other risky maneuvers. I am currently in the accumulation phase of my strategy, and I will continue to follow this approach, looking for opportunities to safely grow my portfolio without falling prey to manipulation tactics. My goal is to steadily increase my total portfolio value over the long term, rather than chasing short-term gains that could be wiped out by a sudden market dump."
